{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33642","headline":"下第有感 · 邵谒","name":"下第有感","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"古人有遗言，天地如掌阔。\n我行三十载，青云路未达。\n尝闻读书者，所贵免征伐。\n谁知失意时，痛於刃伤骨。\n身如石上草，根蔕浅难活。\n人人皆爱春，我独愁花发。\n如何归故山，相携采薇蕨。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"邵谒","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33642.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33642","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}